{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29383","headline":"哭刘蕡 · 李商隐","name":"哭刘蕡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上帝深宫闭九阍，巫咸不下问衔冤。\n广陵别後春涛隔，湓浦书来秋雨翻。\n只有安仁能作诔，何曾宋玉解招魂。\n平生风义兼师友，不敢同君哭寝门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29383.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29383","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}